{"ticker":"GEV","updated":"2026-10-23T23:01:45Z","profile":{"longName":"GE Vernova Inc.","shortName":"GE Vernova Inc.","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","country":"United States","website":"https://www.gevernova.com","fullTimeEmployees":78000,"marketCap":217061867520,"trailingPE":23.365826,"forwardPE":32.35245,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":5.247223,"pegRatio":1.62,"targetMeanPrice":1223.9773,"targetHighPrice":1450.0,"targetLowPrice":940.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":33,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.219,"earningsGrowth":0.328,"grossMargins":0.2057,"operatingMargins":0.07466,"profitMargins":0.23035,"totalRevenue":41366999040,"beta":0.967,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":1195.94,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":530.16,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.24},"summary":"GE Vernova Inc., an energy company, engages in the provision of various products and services that generate, transfer, orchestrate, convert, and store electricity in the United States, Europe, Asia, the Middle East, and Africa. The company operates through three segments: Power, Wind, and Electrification. The Power segment designs, manufactures, and services gas, nuclear, hydro, and steam technologies. It serves industrial, government, and other customers. The Wind segment offers wind generation technologies, including onshore and offshore wind turbines and blades. The Electrification segment provides grid solutions; power conversion; electrification software; and solar and storage solutions technologies required for the transmission, distribution, conversion, storage, and orchestration of electricity from point of generation to point of consumption. The company was incorporated in 2023 and is headquartered in Cambridge, Massachusetts.","summary_zh":"GE Vernova Inc. 是一家能源公司，在美國、歐洲、亞洲、中東和非洲提供各種發電、傳輸、協調、轉換和儲存電力的產品和服務。該公司透過三個部門運作：電力部門、風能部門和電氣化部門。電力部門設計、製造天然氣、核能、水力和蒸汽技術並提供服務。它為工業、政府和其他客戶提供服務。風能部門提供風力發電技術，包括陸上和離岸風力渦輪機和葉片。電氣化部門提供電網解決方案；功率轉換；電氣化軟體；從發電點到用電點的電力傳輸、分配、轉換、儲存和編排所需的太陽能和儲存解決方案技術。該公司成立於 2023 年，總部位於馬薩諸塞州劍橋。","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"特種工業機械","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":608.83,"h":614.471,"l":597.034,"c":602.31,"v":2130000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":603.85,"h":628.58,"l":603.042,"c":625.91,"v":2689400},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":625.22,"h":629.935,"l":618.0,"c":622.39,"v":1862900},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":626.78,"h":646.95,"l":626.78,"c":633.69,"v":2256400},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":631.86,"h":635.0,"l":609.34,"c":612.97,"v":2266400},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":590.55,"h":594.0,"l":567.86,"c":579.68,"v":5267300},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":586.285,"h":586.285,"l":565.43,"c":577.04,"v":3657500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":580.81,"h":600.37,"l":580.06,"c":598.81,"v":3195400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":599.96,"h":604.5,"l":565.5,"c":582.08,"v":3477700},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":594.41,"h":606.0,"l":584.94,"c":600.23,"v":2513700},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":606.35,"h":607.69,"l":594.77,"c":605.7,"v":1863900},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":625.0,"h":645.19,"l":623.0,"c":643.56,"v":3878700},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":648.75,"h":653.5,"l":620.1,"c":634.15,"v":4099900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":632.12,"h":646.88,"l":624.15,"c":625.55,"v":2640400},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":630.15,"h":639.89,"l":624.1,"c":628.68,"v":1851900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":629.5,"h":633.52,"l":608.73,"c":617.91,"v":3104100},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":616.4,"h":619.114,"l":601.12,"c":614.79,"v":2058400},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":622.96,"h":627.1,"l":611.0,"c":611.0,"v":2245600},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":611.69,"h":625.66,"l":596.506,"c":624.17,"v":4107300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":620.11,"h":648.5,"l":620.11,"c":644.37,"v":2566000},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":644.68,"h":644.721,"l":622.2,"c":633.41,"v":2427200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":640.0,"h":642.0,"l":624.19,"c":628.97,"v":1617200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":614.905,"h":619.747,"l":593.38,"c":607.52,"v":3202500},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":610.0,"h":615.14,"l":598.11,"c":605.17,"v":1845300},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":612.45,"h":616.44,"l":596.38,"c":602.43,"v":2188700},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":604.8